<title>UK: Gold weaker in Europe, seen testing lower levels.</title>
<headline>Gold weaker in Europe, seen testing lower levels.</headline>
<text>
<p>Gold - Opens Wednesday at $315.75/$316.25 vs $321.70/322.20 at London close. Bearish sentiment prevails after Tuesday's short covering. Test of lower levels expected.</p>
<p>Silver - $4.26/$4.28 vs $4.35/$4.37.</p>
<p>Platinum - $396.00/$401.00 vs $408.00/$412.00.</p>
<p>Palladium - $170.00/$174.00 vs $174.00/$178.00.</p>
</text>
